    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>I am very interested in EQ II. It would be cool if everyone could all be on the same level. No camping, no bull etc. A whole new world of online gaming where power leveling would be unheard of and no one would have the upper hand unless, of course, they are of a higher level. <br> &nbsp;<br> Check out the Horizons Website. I will find it out and post here for all to check out. It is a online game where natural distaster's play an integral part of the game, let alone having to defend your town or home from the rising armies of the undead. Atari is putting this game out. <br> &nbsp;<br> After all is said and done, I still think EQ is an awesome game. One of the best I have ever played. &nbsp;<br> &nbsp;<br> All of the above games are unique and enable the player to interact and &quot;socailize&quot; with other gamers around the world. <br> &nbsp;<br> Having said that, see you soon on the flip side of the screen. <br> &nbsp;<br> Nemendell </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
<a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=4;action=post;num=1074788307;start=4;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/reply.gif" alt="Reply" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Reply</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=4;action=post;num=1074788307;quote=4;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Quote" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgwindowbg">Quote</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=4;action=notify;thread=1074788307;start="><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/notify.gif" alt="Notify of replies" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Notify of replies</font></a>
    </font></td>
