    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=mandrax" alt="View Profile: skotz">mandrax</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=skotz" alt="View Profile: skotz">skotz</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>It is amazing that I have played this game for nearly 5 years and there are so many places I have never been! <br> I am so happy that I changed servers to be with you folks <br> &nbsp;<br> Kay that is it for the &quot;fuzzy&quot; moment <br> &nbsp;<br> Erianx </font></td>
