    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Nemendell" alt="View Profile: Nemendell">Nemendell</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Nemendell" alt="View Profile: Nemendell">Nemendell</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>I am more interested in the countries history than anything. I am intrigued and very curious to discover more about Europe, but I am not sure if I can physically complete my arduous journeys and i am not prepared to tell you why. I am glad to inform you that I am still alive and enjoy what I am able to do. <br> &nbsp;<br> Be safe everyone and until next time... have a good sin! <br> &nbsp;<br> Nemendell Epony </font></td>
