  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2><b>Name:</b> Gespho <br> <b>Level &amp; Class:</b>    50 <br> <b>Alts:</b> None   &nbsp;<br> <b>How long have you played EQ? </b>   Going on a year <br> <b>What is your style of playing?</b> I like to raid at any place, and get lots of exp anywhere, i solo and cast, solo most the time, but let pet do most the work if i cant.     <br> <b>Style of Play:</b>I like adventuring, no not LDoN, but going places and killing mobs for people, and taking pics, i dont like leveling hardcore, 24/7, it get boring and rep. after a while.   <br> <b>Have you been in a guild before?</b>    Yes <br> <b>Which guild? </b>   (I can not say) <br> <b>Why did you leave?</b>    they were doing nothing, and not helping there guild members, nor me. <br> <b>Why are you applying to EoD?</b>    Cause alot of people say u all dont have alot, but size doesnt matter, in some cases it does, and i have heard u all are good, thats also why. <br> <b>From our perspective, why should we make you a part of our guild?</b> Cause i will help out whenever on, as long as i get help in the long run, Epics, items, raids, u name it, im there. But when i come to ask for help, dont dis me. </font></td>
